%%{init: {"theme": "default"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant App as Next.js App
  participant Act as tokenProvider<br/>server action
  participant S as Stream Video API
  participant H as History<br/>upcoming / previous

  U->>App: Dashboard cards
  App->>App: Create or schedule meeting
  App-->>U: Shareable link + one-tap copy
  U->>App: Open meeting link
  App->>App: Setup preview (mic/camera toggles)
  App->>Act: Request token (Clerk session)
  Act->>S: StreamClient.createToken (1h)
  S-->>Act: Token
  Act-->>App: Token (secret never leaves server)
  App->>S: Join or create call by ID
  S-->>App: Media + call state
  App-->>U: Call grid
  U->>App: Leave
  App->>H: File under upcoming or previous by starts_at
  App->>App: Recordings resolve to Stream playback URLs
